Dear alumni and friends,

Thanks to your generosity, 214 students received scholarship support this year and the library stayed open late through finals. Spring is the time we ask you to consider a gift to the Hartwell Fund, which supports financial aid, faculty research and campus programs.

If you gave last year, thank you; if not, we hope you will join us. Gifts of any size count, and our reunion classes are competing for the highest participation.

Give online or reply to this message to talk with the advancement team. Hartwell College is a nonprofit and gifts are tax deductible to the extent allowed by law.

